<title>JAPAN: MOF likely to offer 20-yr JGBs on Tuesday - traders.</title>
<headline>MOF likely to offer 20-yr JGBs on Tuesday - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry is likely to offer 20-year Japanese government bonds through a price-competitive auction on Tuesday, bond traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the offer amount was likely to be 400 billion yen, unchanged from the previous 20-year JGB auction held on April 8.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
